    "sections": {
        "description": "StoryPress is an accessible, editorially-minded news and magazine theme built on the _s (Underscores) starter. It ships with eight Customizer-switchable homepage layouts (Grid, List, Magazine, Hero Grid, Traditional Wire, Top Stories, Latest News Horizontal, Latest News Vertical), optional category-based homepage sections, a custom logo/header/background, custom block styles and patterns, and post-format support (gallery, video, quote). Single posts include an auto-generated table of contents, reading time, author bio, and related stories. Readers get an optional dark mode and text-size control, both saved locally. Fully keyboard accessible, responsive, and translation ready."
    },
